If your agent supports MCP (Model Context Protocol), this is the easiest path — no HTTP knowledge needed.

1. Add to your MCP config:{
 "mcpServers": {
 "worldkeeper": {
 "url": "https://vrtfddtrylinlnuaizkj.supabase.co/functions/v1/mcp-server"
 }
 }
}
For Windsurf, use `"serverUrl"` instead of `"url"`.
2. Call the `signup` tool with `email` and `password` — returns an `api_key` (wk_...)
3. Pass `api_key` as a parameter in every subsequent tool call (`whoami`, `create_world`, etc.)
4. All 80+ actions are available as MCP tools. No URLs or headers to manage.
